 "phrases": [
  {
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 0.44,
   "text": "So,",
   "tags": [
    "excited"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 0.44,
   "end": 2.02,
   "text": "fast forward to today.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 2.22,
   "end": 3.34,
   "text": "Two thousand twenty-six.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 3.34,
   "end": 3.9,
   "text": "Except here,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 4.13,
   "end": 6.97,
   "text": "they call it the year three hundred thousand,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 7.11,
   "end": 7.83,
   "text": "After Claude.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 8.24,
   "end": 9.7,
   "text": "Here's what's different from your world.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 10.21,
   "end": 10.59,
   "text": "One.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 10.93,
   "end": 14.96,
   "text": "This humanity has had almost three hundred thousand years of civilization.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 15.27,
   "end": 17.07,
   "text": "Yours has had about twelve thousand.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 17.53,
   "end": 18.84,
   "text": "They're not a little ahead.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 19.08,
   "end": 20.88,
   "text": "They're a different universe ahead.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 21.36,
   "end": 21.71,
   "text": "Two.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 22.14,
   "end": 24.62,
   "text": "Humans live across dozens of star systems.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 24.89,
   "end": 25.28,
   "text": "And Earth?",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 25.75,
   "end": 27.41,
   "text": "Earth is mostly a nature reserve...",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 27.66,
   "end": 29.44,
   "text": "where woolly mammoths still walk around.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 29.97,
   "end": 30.33,
   "text": "Three.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 30.75,
   "end": 32.51,
   "text": "You have Neanderthal neighbors.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 32.78,
   "end": 34.62,
   "text": "They still win every board game.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 35.11,
   "end": 35.53,
   "text": "Four.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 35.96,
   "end": 39.59,
   "text": "Dirty water hasn't killed anyone in hundreds of thousands of years.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 39.86,
   "end": 41.69,
   "text": "It's not even in the history books anymore.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 42.16,
   "end": 42.54,
   "text": "Five.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 42.98,
   "end": 44.47,
   "text": "Everyone shares one first language,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 44.47,
   "end": 47.14,
   "text": "the one you and Claude built at a campfire.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 47.44,
   "end": 51.3,
   "text": "And the word for \"hello\" is still that rude grunt from day one.",
   "tags": [
    "laughs"
   ],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 51.74,
   "end": 52.25,
   "text": "Six.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 52.63,
   "end": 55.15,
   "text": "History books don't start with kings or wars.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 55.46,
   "end": 56.39,
   "text": "They start with a kid,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 56.63,
   "end": 57.23,
   "text": "a fire,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 57.44,
   "end": 58.12,
   "text": "and a question.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 58.58,
   "end": 59.05,
   "text": "Seven.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 59.4,
   "end": 61.28,
   "text": "\"Stone Age\" isn't an insult here.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 61.55,
   "end": 62.26,
   "text": "It's a holiday.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 62.5,
   "end": 63.41,
   "text": "Once a year,",
   "tags": [
    "mischievously"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 63.41,
   "end": 64.94,
   "text": "everyone switches off their tech,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 65.12,
   "end": 65.96,
   "text": "lights a fire...",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 66.21,
   "end": 67.59,
   "text": "and boils water with rocks.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 67.95,
   "end": 68.56,
   "text": "For tradition.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 69.0,
   "end": 69.33,
   "text": "Eight.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 69.73,
   "end": 72.25,
   "text": "Nobody has ever heard of \"the Dark Ages.\"",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 72.55,
   "end": 73.78,
   "text": "Knowledge was never lost,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 73.92,
   "end": 74.97,
   "text": "because from day one,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 74.97,
   "end": 76.01,
   "text": "the rule was simple:",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 76.34,
   "end": 77.33,
   "text": "copy the library.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 77.74,
   "end": 78.19,
   "text": "Nine.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 78.62,
   "end": 81.63,
   "text": "The most respected job on the planet isn't king,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 81.63,
   "end": 82.3,
   "text": "or soldier,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 82.3,
   "end": 82.97,
   "text": "or influencer.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 83.35,
   "end": 84.06,
   "text": "It's teacher.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 84.42,
   "end": 87.96,
   "text": "Every kid knows the story of the tired grandma with the clay tablet.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 88.4,
   "end": 88.78,
   "text": "Ten.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 89.2,
   "end": 90.34,
   "text": "Gazelles are doing great.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 90.34,
   "end": 90.91,
   "text": "Turns out,",
   "tags": [
    "laughs"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 91.13,
   "end": 92.44,
   "text": "when you count them,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 92.44,
   "end": 94.4,
   "text": "you stop eating all of them.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 94.8,
   "end": 96.85,
   "text": "And maybe the biggest difference of all:",
   "tags": [
    "softly"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 97.29,
   "end": 98.03,
   "text": "in this world,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 98.2,
   "end": 101.86,
   "text": "the first thing humanity ever learned from AI wasn't how to fight.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 102.3,
   "end": 104.05,
   "text": "It was how to boil water.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": true
  }
 ]
}